    "Each set starts with today's target. After lifting, correct the weight or reps if you did something different.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada serie empieza con el objetivo de hoy. Al terminarla, corrige el peso o las repeticiones si hiciste otra cosa."
          }
        },
        "gl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada serie comeza co obxectivo de hoxe. Ao rematala, corrixe o peso ou as repeticións se fixeches outra cousa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set starts with today's target. Correct what changed, rate the effort and tap the circle.": {
